{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421202001:0":{"text":"페리엘에 관한 일 때문에 찾아뵙게 되었습니다.","source_cn":"其实，这次找你是为了斐利尔的事情。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48088D9A52532452","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"페리엘에 관한 일 때문에 찾아뵙게 되었습니다.","female":"페리엘에 관한 일 때문에 찾아뵙게 되었습니다.","variant_male_record_index":"164739","variant_female_record_index":"164740","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421202002:0":{"text":"이쪽은 리브라고 합니다. 저희에게 전할 중요한 물건이 있다고 하는군요. ","source_cn":"旁边这位是丽芙，她有重要的东西要交给我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF199796A9C55F75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421202003:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 저, 저는 리브라고 해요. 페리엘 님을 모시던 견습 제사장이었어요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x379AC9E6AA40D128","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 저, 저는 리브라고 해요. 페리엘 님을 모시던 견습 제사장이었어요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님... 저, 저는 리브라고 해요. 페리엘 님을 모시던 견습 제사장이었어요.","variant_male_record_index":"164742","variant_female_record_index":"164743","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421202004:0":{"text":"페리엘 님이 돌아가신 뒤에, 퀸 대제사장님이 사람을 보내서 페리엘 님의 물건을 전부 처분하려고 하는 걸 봤어요...","source_cn":"斐利尔大人去世后，我看到奎茵大祭司正派人销毁斐利尔大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82D1B6AB8D4DED38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::1":{"text":"페리엘의 연구 노트","source_cn":"斐利尔的研究笔记","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8250D3782D409ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421202005:2":{"text":"그, 그래서 몰래 물건들을 챙겨서 나왔는데... 죄송해요. 이것밖에 못 챙겨왔어요.","source_cn":"我、我就偷偷溜进去拿出了这个。对不起，我只拿出了这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A35E9EEC73C998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1421202005":{"text":"그, 그래서 몰래 물건들을 챙겨서 나왔는데... 죄송해요. 이것밖에 못 챙겨왔어요.","source_cn":"我、我就偷偷溜进去拿出了这个。对不起，我只拿出了这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A35E9EEC73C998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421202006:0":{"text":"흑... 다 끝났어요... 그래서 이제서야 인듀어 님을 찾아온 거예요...","source_cn":"呜呜，现在一切都过去了。所以我才来找到因度厄大人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F087DDD705D9FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421202007:1":{"text":"페리엘의 비밀을 엿볼 생각은 아니지만, 너무 갑자기 떠난 탓에...","source_cn":"我无意窥探斐利尔的秘密。只是，他离开得太突然了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE24CD4DD3ACCB829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t